   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <opener>
                        <dateline>
                            <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_PARI">Paris</name>
                            <lb/>
                            <date when="1936-02-29">29.2.’36</date>
                        </dateline>
                    </opener>
                    <p>Many happy <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">returns of the day</seg>.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">J.J.</name>
                        </signed>
                    </closer>
                    <postscript>
                        <p>
                            <label>PS.</label> I hear <name type="person" key="mati69">Matisse</name>’s things <seg xml:id="seg2" type="note-anchor">are on show</seg> at Leicester Gallery.</p>
                    </postscript>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">Budgen’s birthday was on 1 March; in 1936, he would have been 54.</note>
                <note xml:id="note2" target="#seg2" type="commentary">In February 1936, the Leicester Galleries in London held an exhibition of drawings and lithographs by Henri Matisse which included those used in the edition of <name type="work" key="W_ULYSSES">Ulysses</name> he illustrated (New York: Limited Editions Club, 1935).</note>
            </div>
      </body>
